# TanStack root route

`routes/__root.tsx` must stay a thin wrapper. App chrome lives in `@/app/components/root-shell.tsx`.

## Do

- Keep `__root.tsx` as `createRootRoute({ component: RootShell })` only
- Edit layout and IPC navigation in `root-shell.tsx`

## Don't

- Replace `__root.tsx` with TanStack's default scaffold (`Hello "__root__"!`)
- Move `Tray.Library` or `window.pond.onNavigate` into `__root.tsx`
- Delete `root-shell.tsx` without moving its contents somewhere equivalent

```tsx
// Good: thin route file
import { createRootRoute } from "@tanstack/react-router";
import { RootShell } from "@/app/components/root-shell";

export const Route = createRootRoute({ component: RootShell });
```

The TanStack Router Vite plugin can overwrite route files with boilerplate while dev is running. Never scaffold this file manually.
